OL,3,AFirst Children's Booker prize reveals
OL,4,Ashortlist - and its child judges
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first ever Children's Booker Prize
OL,7,Fhas announced the eight books in the
OL,8,Frunning for the new #50,000 award.
OL,10,FFive novels, two graphic novels and an
OL,11,Fillustrated collection of short stories
OL,12,Fare on the shortlist, which is aimed at
OL,13,Fchildren aged eight to 12.
OL,15,FThe authors in contention include
OL,16,Fformer Children's Laureate of Ireland
OL,17,FEoin Colfer, who is best known for his
OL,18,FArtemis Fowl series, and teacher and
OL,19,Fchildren's author Catherine Bruton.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
